From: Agriya Khetarpal <74401230+agriyakhetarpal@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:39:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Export _Py_CheckEmscriptenSignalsPeriodically

The test interpreter in Modules/_testinternalcapi/interpreter.c uses the
ceval macros, which call this function on Emscripten. When
_testinternalcapi is built as a shared extension, the symbol has to be
visible in the main module.
---
 Python/emscripten_signal.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Python/emscripten_signal.c b/Python/emscripten_signal.c
index 8d91e29..35ca5bf 100644
--- a/Python/emscripten_signal.c
+++ b/Python/emscripten_signal.c
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@ _Py_CheckEmscriptenSignals(void)
 #define PY_EMSCRIPTEN_SIGNAL_INTERVAL 50
 EMSCRIPTEN_KEEPALIVE int _Py_emscripten_signal_clock = PY_EMSCRIPTEN_SIGNAL_INTERVAL;
 
-void
+EMSCRIPTEN_KEEPALIVE void
 _Py_CheckEmscriptenSignalsPeriodically(void)
 {
     if (_Py_emscripten_signal_clock == 0) {
